  picture: {fileID: -5717049752745662821, guid: 961aee62321df4c40b9eaca0050d1354, type: 3}
  loreText: "The oldest remedy in the land: Wardleaf to close the wound, Emberbloom
    to wake the blood, all in clean glass. Every traveller who leaves the village
    carries at least one, and every one who forgets wishes they hadn\u2019t."
